    "show_share": true,
    "description": "JCIA triennial survey of AKUH,K was conducted via video conference from January 28 to February 1, 2013.  Based on the findings, the JCI Accreditation Committee has approved an extension of the status of accreditation to the Aga Khan University Hospital for a period of 18 months, ending October 1, 2014.",
